Package: booksetup
Title: Prepare Local Data for the SITS Book
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Rolf", "Simoes", , "rolf.simoes@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts R code chunks from the sitsbook Quarto files and
    builds a standalone data-generation script so the book can be rendered
    without manually re-running each chunk.
